---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Pickleball en La Fortuna"
  description="Tres canchas de pickleball con vista al Volcán Arenal en La Fortuna, Costa Rica."
>
  <!-- Portada -->
  <section
    class="relative flex min-h-[680px] items-center bg-cover bg-center pt-20 lg:min-h-[780px]"
    style="background-image: url('/images/Image1');"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-volcan-dark via-volcan-blue/80 to-volcan-blue/30"
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12"
    >
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p
          class="mb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-volcan-green"
        >
          La Fortuna, Costa Rica
        </p>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
        >
          Pickleball con vista al Volcán Arenal
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-200 sm:text-lg md:text-xl"
        >
          Disfruta nuestras tres canchas, participa en los Open Play
          y forma parte de la comunidad de Volcan Courts.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="/canchas"
            class="rounded-lg bg-volcan-green px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-extrabold text-volcan-dark transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-lime-300"
          >
            Conocer las canchas
          </a>

          <a
            href="/open-play"
            class="rounded-lg border-2 border-volcan-green px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-extrabold text-white transition hover:bg-volcan-green hover:text-volcan-dark"
          >
            Ver Open Play
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Presentación -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p
        class="mb-3 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-volcan-blue"
      >
        Volcan Courts
      </p>

      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-black text-volcan-dark sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
      >
        Una experiencia única en La Fortuna
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-volcan-gray sm:text-lg">
        Contamos con tres canchas para juegos recreativos, clases,
        Open Play y torneos, rodeadas de naturaleza y con una vista
        privilegiada al Volcán Arenal.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"
    >
      <article
        class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-lg shadow-blue-950/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-volcan-blue">01</span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-black">Tres canchas</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-volcan-gray">
          Instalaciones para partidos, clases, clínicas y torneos.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-lg shadow-blue-950/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-volcan-blue">02</span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-black">Open Play</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-volcan-gray">
          Actividades organizadas para distintos niveles de juego.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article
        class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-lg shadow-blue-950/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"
      >
        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-volcan-blue">03</span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-black">Vista al volcán</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-volcan-gray">
          Una experiencia deportiva diferente en La Fortuna.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Open Play -->
  <section class="bg-volcan-blue text-white">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-8 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between lg:py-24"
    >
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p
          class="mb-3 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-volcan-green"
        >
          Agenda semanal
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          Encuentra tu próximo Open Play
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 text-blue-100 sm:text-lg">
          Conoce los horarios y actividades disponibles para cada nivel.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/open-play"
        class="shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-volcan-green px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-extrabold text-volcan-dark transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-lime-300"
      >
        Consultar horarios
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>